      "writtenOn": "2017-10-10T22:03:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How big are the outputs here? I did have some local patches that attempted to remove everything but the log files, since most of the sizes are the ninja files, and much of the use I\u0027ve had is with the std.log files.\n\nAnd why switch this from flag.String -\u003e init() { flag.StringVar }?",
