      "writtenOn": "2017-10-11T02:13:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the case of aosp_x86_arm:\n\nThe uncompressed size (reported by `du -ch .`) is 1.3GB and the compressed size is 82M.\n\nI\u0027m running another build which should let me confirm the exact totals.\n\nThe last time I ran it, I was able to store two copies on disk so ninja_diff.sh could unzip+diff+remove each product one at a time\n\nThe files that I\u0027m interested in are the ninja files (for confirming that build graphs haven\u0027t changed), but since the ninja files are most of the size I figured I might as well save, zip, and compare all of the generated files. I could see it making sense for there to be another option of \"keep\", perhaps equal to \"logs\", which would keep only the log files.\n\n\nThe move from var to init was accidental and I\u0027ll put it back.",
      "parentUuid": "584a1792_65ba190c",
